            "review_title": "Review at Nhà Hàng Chay Bà Xã",
            "review_text": "mumanddrmax\nMelbourne, Australia61 contributions\n0\nExcellent vegan restaurant - we eent to outlet 2 in District 3\nJan 2020 • Family\nWe went to the second outlet at 107K Truong Dinh Phuong 6, Quan 3. The restaurant is pleasant and air conditioned and the staff are lovely. The food is well priced (we paid 650,000 dong for 7 dishes, extra rice and 4 drinks (no alcohol)). Great vegan food including tasty salads and a really good green curry. Happy to be able to pay with credit card and no hidden taxes or sevice fees.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 4, 2020",
